다음 Java codes 의 LifelineSite 와 ResidentialSite 클래스는 두 명의 다른
개발자에 의해서 동시에 구현되었다. 해당 코드의 문제점을 분석하고, Form
Template Method 기법을 이용하여 Refactoring 하시오.
public abstract class Site {
static final double TAX_RATE = 0.5;
public abstract double getBillableAmount(int units, double rate);
}
public class LifelineSite extends Site {
public double getBillableAmount(int units, double rate) {
double base = units * rate * 0.5;
double tax = base * Site.TAX_RATE * 0.2;
return base + tax;
}
}
public class ResidentialSite extends Site {
public double getBillableAmount(int units, double rate) {
double base = units * rate;
double tax = base * Site.TAX_RATE;
return base + tax;
}
}

